            <div xml:id="d137-a3">

                <pb facs="0334" n="238" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg238"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure B in Mr. Bee’s letter.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Higby to Mr. Bee.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your note of yesterday receved, referring
                    to the Roscoe cigar manufactory, &amp;c., I regret I cannot comply with your
                    request. By doing so I would violate a rule I had to establish to protect the
                    interest of the government.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed>WILLIAM HIGBY, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Collector.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
